message: "If you use this skill in your research or writing, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "academic-writer: A Claude Skill for Humanities and Social-Science Academic Writing"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-09
authors:
  - alias: tizzy916
abstract: >
  A Claude Code / Claude Agent SDK skill that turns Claude into a thinking partner
  for humanities and social-science academic writing — not a polishing tool,
  but an interlocutor that engages with arguments, concepts, and voice.
  Features four-layer critique (foundation/structure/paragraph/sentence),
  devil's-advocate mode with anti-sycophancy thresholds, deep-style preservation
  ("write as I speak"), reflexive-writing support for human-AI co-authoring research,
  ADHD-friendly interaction design, and engineering-grade infrastructure
  (version control, systematic validation, AI-trace scanning scripts).
keywords:
